{"sourceUrl":"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/2026/0716/c17770a397562/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.277736+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/2026/0716/c17770a397562/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span><span><span>   为</span><span><span>促进优秀大学生之间学术交流</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>深化广大优秀本科生对哈工大苏州高等研究院产教融合研究生培养模式的了解</span></span><span>，研究院定于</span></span></span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日至</span><span>7</span><span><span><span>日举办暑期学术交流营活动。</span><span><span>欢迎有意申请攻读哈尔滨工业大学苏州专项专业学位直博生的同学踊跃报名。</span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、哈工大苏州高等研究院简介</span></span></strong></p><p><span>哈工大苏州高等研究院是苏州市人民政府（吴中区人民政府）和哈尔滨工业大学于</span><span>2023</span><span><span><span>年合作共建的，服务国家科技自立自强、服务地方经济高质量发展的综合性研究院，致力于建成区域人才新高地、区域创新策源地和科技产业孵化示范区。</span><span><span>研究院</span></span><span>围绕长三角地区和苏州</span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span><span>1030</span><span>”</span></span><span><span><span>产业体系，以立德树人为根本任务，以服务国家战略和行业高端人才需求为宗旨，以向区域重点领域输送思正、品端、赋有工匠精神和创造激情，敢为人先的高水平工程技术人才为目标，以实践创新能力培养为重点，强化</span><span><span>“</span></span><span>企业出题</span><span><span>、</span></span><span>师生答题</span><span><span>”</span></span><span>的产教融合育人机制，校企联合培养专业学位硕士</span><span><span>、</span></span><span>博士研究生，为国家</span><span><span>与</span></span><span>区域重点领域输送具备解决复杂工程问题和技术创新能力的高层次工程</span><span><span>技术</span></span><span>领军人</span><span><span>才</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>二</span></span><span>、招募对象</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span>爱党爱国、诚实守信、学风端正、身心健康。</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>能够在本科所在学校取得推荐免试研究生（简称推免生）资格的一流大学</span><span>2027</span><span>年优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span><span><span>有志攻读电子信息、机械、材料与化工、能源动力专业类博士研究生的</span><span><span>优先考虑</span></span><span>。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>外语水平优良。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>三</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>申请流程</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span><span><span>申请形式</span></span><span>：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>填写</span><span><span>表单报名，表单链接</span></span></span></span><span><span><a href=\"https://f.wps.cn/ksform/h/write/GikuLhCW/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://f.wps.cn/ksform/h/write/GikuLhCW/</a></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span><span>2.</span><span>报名时间：</span><span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>17</span></span><span>日至</span><span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>23</span></span><span>日。</span></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://sri.hit.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/91/ab/4732ad8a49d88f205a3e6a1a4197/7be7ed3a-f28d-4762-9dc8-8259e77b59e9.png\"/></p><p><span> 3.</span><span>报名材料：</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）个人简历（一页）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章成绩排名证明原件的扫描件（原件备查），其中证明内容须注明该排名对应的学期数及所在专业总人数；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）所在院（系）或学校教务处盖章的成绩单原件的扫描件（原件备查）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）体现英语水平证明材料（国家英语四六级，</span><span>TOEFL</span><span>成绩，</span><span>GRE</span><span>成绩等）；</span></p><p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span><span>其他证明材料，包括：</span><span><span>①</span></span><span>已发表论文。其中代表性论文</span></span></span><span>1</span><span><span><span>篇，应提供全文，其他已发表论文提供期刊目录、论文首页；</span><span><span>②</span></span><span>本科期间各类获奖证书</span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>③</span></span><span>其他突出表现的证明材料。</span></span></span></p><p><span>注：以上材料原件在入营时审核。</span></p><p><span>以上所有材料按顺序合并成一个</span><span>PDF</span><span><span><span><span>文件</span></span><span>，以</span><span><span>“</span></span><span>本科学校名称</span></span></span><span>-</span><span>姓名</span><span>-</span><span><span><span>预报名专业</span><span><span>的序号</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span>格式命名，如</span><span><span>“</span></span></span></span><span>xx</span><span>大学</span><span>-</span><span>张</span><span><span>xx-1</span><span>”</span></span><span>，并上传至报名表单。如文件上传失败，请发送至邮箱：</span><span>suzhou@hit.edu.cn</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span><span>预报名专业的序号为：</span><span><span>①</span></span><span>电子信息；</span><span><span>②</span></span><span>机械；</span><span><span>③</span></span><span>材料与化工；</span><span><span>④</span></span><span>能源动力。</span></span></span></p><p><span>4.</span><span>确定名单：</span></p><p><span><span><span><span>研究院</span></span><span>根据申请者的网上报名信息，重点考察申请者学业水平、科研能力和综合素质，确定入营者名单，并预计于</span></span></span><span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>27</span></span><span><span><span>日前通过邮件或电话的方式通知入营者。（</span><span><strong><span>届时未入营者，不再另行通知</span></strong></span><span>）</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>四</span></span><span>、活动安排</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span><span><span>活动</span></span><span>时间：</span></span></span><span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span>年</span><span>8</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日至</span><span>7</span><span>日</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span><span><span><span>报到</span></span><span>地点：哈工大苏州</span><span><span>高等</span></span><span>研究院</span></span></span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>活动内容：</span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>【第一天】</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>营员报到、开营预备会</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>【第二天】</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>开营仪式、</span></span><span>企业参访</span><span><span>交流、</span></span><span>苏州文化探访</span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>企业</span></span><span>微课题揭榜</span><span><span>挑战</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span>【第三天】</span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>成果展示、</span></span><span>闭营仪式</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>五</span></span><span>、其他说明</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span><span><span>研究院</span><span><span>将为所有营员提供学术交流营期间</span></span><span>营员的用餐</span><span><span>和</span></span><span>人身保险，不提供住宿、往返交通及其它费用。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span>营员报到后要求全程参加学术交流营的活动，严禁擅自离队</span><span><span>，</span></span><span>活动期间学生人身及财产安全由本人负责。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span>具体日程可能根据实际情况进行调整</span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span>具体政策以学校当年的文件为准。</span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span>六</span></span><span>、</span><span><span>联系方式</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>联系人</span><span><span>：</span></span><span><span>朱</span></span><span>老师</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span></span><span>0512-66528060</span></p><p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span><span><span>suzhou@hit.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span>哈工大苏州高等研究院</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></p></div>","textSha256":"aa67101c986ff8b2384d2220c6bab98d6f98c575a4ce282401a505e8a81c89ac","textLength":1455,"sourceSha256":"a092694e63b0669e83721c1090390b92511aeaffcb49cd17d795c33942c12524","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-485717eb20cb72cfe3af","title":"2026年哈尔滨工业大学苏州研究院苏州专项2026年暑期学术交流营的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:52.277736+00:00"}
